//   clk_div1     : posedge register, toggles at cnt==3 and cnt==6
//                  -> low for cnt 0,1,2,3 (4 cycles), high for cnt 4,5,6 (3 cycles)
//   clk_div2     : negedge register, clk_div1 delayed by half a source period
//   clk_div      : clk_div1 | clk_div2  -> uniform 3.5 / 3.5 (50% duty) period
